:: LaaB V0.04.01

<strong>=Life as a Boy V0.04.01 "The Hang Out Update" Change Log"=</strong>

<strong>=Hang Outs=</strong>
-You can now Hang Out with all 11 Major Characters. (3 Family, 8 Classmates.) 
-Classmate Hang Outs can be unlocked after gaining enough Social. The option will appear after school when waiting for the Bus when interacting with your classmates.
-Family Hang Outs can be unlocked after gaining enough Social. The option will appear in certain places around the house when interacting with your Family when wearing Bottoms.
-Each character has 1 First Time Quest, 1 Go To Park Event, 2 Leave Early Events, 2 Leave Late Events, and 1 Random Event. (Lucas and Carter still have their old events with some minor behind-the-scene updates.)
-Lucas and Carter's Hang Outs will now require the Intro Quest to be completed. Please allow 1 In-Game Day to pass for the Quest to Unlock.
-Lucas' House First Visit Quest will now require his Hang Out Intro.

