=Other Events/Content=
-A small Farm Location has been added. It contains 6 Travel Events and 1 Explore Event.
-A new Event when Jogging. (Thanks to Zexion.)
-Dad can now leave Sticky Notes when the Player eats their Dinner late. (6) (Thanks to Zexion.)

<strong>=Zach(New) Events/Content=</strong>
-New Large Quest "Brochella-Lite. (Encountered in School South Hallways.)

<strong>=Luca Events/Content=</strong>
-You can now eat Lunch with Luca. (3 Events.)
-After gaining Social, you can encounter Luca on the School Playground for a Special Event.

<strong>=Nikolai Events/Content=</strong>
-New Quest "Dropped Photo". (Encountered in School Hallways.)
-New Event when Changing in the School Locker Room.
-New Event when Showering after Gym Class.

<strong>=Bobby Events/Content=</strong>
-Bobby can now be encountered on his Farm in the new Farm Location.
-You can now "Say Hello" to Bobby at the Barn or Fields. (5 Events)
-One-Time Event where you meet Bobby's friend.
-3 Events where you Help Out Bobby when he is working on the Barn.

<strong>=Erin Events/Content=</strong>
-Erin can now be encountered in the School Cafeteria during Lunch. (1 Event) (Thanks to Zexion.)
-New Event when Showering after Gym Class. (Thanks to Zexion.)
-Erin can now be encountered in Residential Neighborhoods. (1 Event) (Thanks to Zexion.)

<strong>=Kazu Events/Content=</strong>
-New Quest "Kazu: Unexpected Friends" (Requires Social with Kazu & a Certain Canon Classmate.)
-4 New Random Events (Cafeteria Hang Out, Library Hang Out, School Playground Random Event, English Class Random Event)

<strong>=Snowpaw Events/Content=</strong>
-New Quest: "Snowpaw: New Rabbit Around Town" (Requires Meeting Snowpaw, Weekend, Morning, Community Center.)